name: Compact paste controls, single Map paging, and direct terminal input
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY OPENROUTER_API_KEY GEMINI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/compact_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
submit: setup
require-live-snap: 30 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | setup
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 15 Commit this Map plan | start-map
keys: Enter
paste-file: @ART/multiline.txt
require-live-snap: 30 RESULT READY | map-draft
type: ud
require-live-snap: 20 chars⟫ud | map-edited
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/completion_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART map-edited
keys: C-y
require-live-snap: 20 first owned α | appended-paste-inspection
expect: second owned β
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 chars⟫ud | inspection-return
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 20 chars⟫ud | draft-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 20 chars⟫ud | draft-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 20 chars⟫ud | draft-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 20 chars⟫ud | draft-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 chars⟫ud | compact-controls
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/compact_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART compact-controls
ask: Are paste inspection, clear, undo and interrupt readable at 40x12, with the appended draft still editable after the inspector closes?
keys: C-y
require-live-snap: 20 first owned α | compact-inspection
expect: Esc cancel
expect: Ctrl+_ undo after close
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 chars⟫ud | compact-return
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 describe what to map | cleared
keys: C-_
require-live-snap: 20 chars⟫ud | restored
keys: Escape
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/completion_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART map-selected
paste-file: @ART/scan-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 r reuse cached | scan-prerequisite
keys: r
paste-file: @ART/scan-draft.txt
require-live-snap: 30 operator α | scan-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/completion_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART scan-draft
require-live-snap: 30 ○ idle | single-paging
expect-count-at-most: 1 PgUp/PgDn
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/compact_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART single-paging
ask: Does the resting Map name paging once after the actual scan completion, while the unsent draft retains its cursor and input ownership?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 describe what to map | input-cleared
type: terminal α
require-live-snap: 20 terminal α | before-escape-end
keys: Escape End
wait: 1
live-snap: coalesced-escape-end
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/compact_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART coalesced-escape-end
ask: Does the capture show an End escape-sequence fragment entering the composer when Escape and End arrive in one batch? Preserve any defect as open terminal-parser evidence.
keys: C-u
require-live-snap: 20 describe what to map | before-quit
type: quit
require-live-snap: 20 › quit | typed-quit
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/compact_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART typed-quit
keys: Enter
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 30 owned-example | restarted-source
expect: signal-only
paste-file: @ART/multiline.txt
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 inspect paste | no-color-controls
expect: Ctrl+_
expect: undo
ask: Are the compact paste controls readable without color after restart, with the existing policy observation retained?
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 20 y/Y exit n/N/Esc stay | quit-confirmation
expect: command draft
keys: n
require-live-snap: 20 inspect paste | quit-canceled
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 describe what to review | restart-draft-cleared
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/compact_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART state
